{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink bundle feels like a natural next purchase because I already have a Blink camera, and adding a doorbell and more camera coverage gives it a clear purpose in my home.",
    "The Echo Show 8 fits my interest in connected home equipment alongside my Fire TV devices. Its display makes it more useful to me right now than an audio-only speaker."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The earbuds and portable speaker are electronics, but they do not help with the home viewing, recording, and security needs reflected in my recent purchases.",
    "The USB hub solves a need I have not expressed. The memory cards are more plausible after my camcorder purchase, but I would need to confirm compatibility and capacity before choosing one, especially a two-pack."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in electronic devices seems to have been stretched into an assumed interest in unrelated audio products and computer accessories.",
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in any Alexa device, although a smart display appeals to me more than an audio-only Echo Dot."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Already owning a Blink camera makes an expansion of that setup more appealing than starting with another camera brand, even though both serve a security purpose.",
    "A related product still needs a specific role: I would choose the larger Show 8 over the Show 5, and I would check my camcorder's storage requirements before buying cards."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understand my connected home interests, but stretch them too broadly into electronics without a clear current use for me."
}"}
